## What’s Included & What to Bring

### Included with Registration ($149):
* Classroom materials and the official **NRA Guide: Basics of Pistol Shooting** handbook.
* Firearms provided for range use (or you may bring your own).
* Official NRA Course Completion Certificate.

### What to Bring / Additional Expenses:
* Valid Government-Issued Photo ID (Driver's License or Passport).
* Eye and ear protection (available on-site).
* **50–100 rounds of 9mm ammunition** (can be purchased directly at the NRA Range).
* **NRA Range Fee:** $15–$35 (paid directly to the range facility on class day).

> **Important Note:** All personal firearms brought to class must remain completely cased and unloaded until instructed otherwise on the live range.

